x4YY3Tg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOgBfFVZ0ysKFB2t_SaCjrCZ0rUiW45mYuInqJt2YUesA&oe=6ADCB612"}, "display_name": "VAMP", "keywords": ["vamp", "video", "player", "media", "archive"], "long_description": "Enter **VAMP**, Video Archive Mosaic Player.\n\n# Features\n- Massive mosaic wall, up to **300 videos (300@720p, 150@1080p)**\n- Hover to play **instantly** with seamless audio transitions\n- **8000 tabs** per session\n- Intuitive controls optimized for **effortless flow state**\n- Hand-carried **pixel-perfect** curved vector UI\n- Fast-access XR passthrough\n- **2.0/5.1/7.1** surround audio with HRTF\n- Custom C99 Vulkan engine optimized for Quest hardware\n- Low battery draw (~**3 hours playback**)\n\n# What's Next\n- **90 FPS 3D playback for any 2D video** locally on Quest 3 \n- Multi-wall setup (up to **5 surround walls**)\n- Streamer for Windows, macOS, and Linux\n- USB OTG support for external drives\n- Subtitles, bookmarks, and video looping\n- 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0, EAC, 3D (SBS, TTB) and 8K video support\n- Image and music support with background playback\n- Ambisonic spatial audio with custom speaker placement\n- Headset audio streaming to PC speakers", "short_description": "Turn your archive into a living video wall.\nTile up to 300 videos, hover to play instantly.\nEnter VAMP, Video Archive Mosaic Player."}]}, "developer_name": "BAZED", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vamp.video/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BAZED", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vamp.video/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_